            "review_title": "Review at Yolo Ha Giang Local Family Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kyra\n6 contributions\n0\nThe best restaurant in Ha Giang!\nApr 2023 • Friends\nMy sister and I had the privilege of enjoying some of this restaurants food today - it was AMAZING! For breakfast we enjoyed an egg sandwich with pancakes and fruit… the bread was so soft and the lettuce was crispy. This was everything we needed after finishing the loop! The coffee (with condensed milk) was the best we’ve had in Vietnam! We owners were so kind to also let us try their fresh spring rolls and orange ginger beer. The orange ginger beer was next level good… we couldn’t help ourselves but to get a second glass! And the spring rolls were incredibly fresh and complimented by an amazing sweet chilli dipping sauce! I could not recommend this place more! For breakfast, lunch or dinner you will be more then impressed here! Enjoy!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 12, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
